  "decision": "Selected the centroid of the union of the three Cook County 2021 parcel polygons 01-31-201-003, 01-31-202-002 and 01-32-100-005 (the former Sears headquarters campus at 685 and 551 Higgins Road / Beverly Road, Hoffman Estates) as the campus locator for the Compass Datacenters Hoffman Estates campus. The Cook County Assessor's records name Compass Datacenters as the tax-bill mailing name of these PINs for tax years 2023 to 2025 and as owner of their 2026 successor PINs, and the Assessor's building-permit records for PIN 01-31-201-003 are 'COMPASS DATA CENTER ORD I BUILDING 1', 'BUILDING 2 BUILDOUT', 'BUILDING 3 BUILDOUT' and a ComEd substation for Compass. Compass's own release places the campus on the nearly 200-acre former Sears headquarters site; the union measures 191.4 geodesic acres. PIN 01-32-100-006 (3.1 acres, held by another owner and only mailed to Compass in 2026) is not included.",
